  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "One property, six property professionals, and somehow the client becomes the messenger.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.294
    },
    {
      "text": "Sound familiar?",
      "start": 6.691,
      "end": 7.482
    },
    {
      "text": "The perfect property is found, but the requests keep coming.",
      "start": 8.03,
      "end": 12.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Another identity check, another document, another explanation.",
      "start": 12.32,
      "end": 16.791
    },
    {
      "text": "Suddenly, progress feels like paperwork.",
      "start": 17.28,
      "end": 19.88
    },
    {
      "text": "That's where Arixa Systems changes the experience.",
      "start": 20.372,
      "end": 23.409
    },
    {
      "text": "Built by property professionals for property professionals, ARIXA brings property intelligence, financial analysis, reporting, client management, communication, and more into one connected operating environment.",
      "start": 23.886,
      "end": 37.673
    },
    {
      "text": "And here's where it gets exciting.",
      "start": 38.174,
      "end": 39.714
    },
    {
      "text": "Introducing the ARIXA AML CTF compliance passport.",
      "start": 40.223,
      "end": 44.222
    },
    {
      "text": "One digital passport, one organized client record, identity verification, screening and due diligence all in one place.",
      "start": 44.757,
      "end": 53.546
    },
    {
      "text": "With appropriate consent and controlled access, authorized property partners can securely access the client's compliance passport in just a few clicks, supporting legislative compliance while eliminating unnecessary duplication.",
      "start": 54.063,
      "end": 67.376
    },
    {
      "text": "The result?",
      "start": 67.927,
      "end": 68.531
    },
    {
      "text": "Less paperwork, less repetition, better connected professionals, and a smoother property journey without clients constantly providing the same information.",
      "start": 68.944,
      "end": 78.676
    },
    {
      "text": "And that's just one part of Arixa Systems.",
      "start": 79.152,
      "end": 81.452
    },
    {
      "text": "Experience it yourself with a 14-day free trial and discover what a truly connected business can achieve.",
      "start": 81.84,
      "end": 88.204
    },
    {
      "text": "14 days.",
      "start": 88.79,
      "end": 89.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Your business, your experience, your decision.",
      "start": 90.066,
      "end": 93.218
    },
    {
      "text": "ARIXA Systems, the operating system for modern property professionals.",
      "start": 93.58,
      "end": 97.977
    },
    {
      "text": "Start your free trial today.",
      "start": 98.312,
      "end": 99.783
    }
  ],
